# Surface recycling reactions for D+/D/D2 neutral transport
# Format: reactant --> product(s)
#         type prob energy1 [energy2]
# type: E=exchange (1->1), D=dissociation (1->2), R=recombination (absorb)
# prob: recycling probability
# energy: return energy per product [eV]

# D+ hits wall -> returns as D atom at Franck-Condon energy (~3 eV)
D+ --> D
E 1.0 3.0

# D hits wall -> reflects as D at wall thermal energy (~0.025 eV = 300K)
D --> D
E 1.0 0.025

# D2 hits wall -> reflects as D2 at wall thermal energy
D2 --> D2
E 1.0 0.025
